WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:14.590
You're sure eating a lot!

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.750
Can't fight on an empty stomach!

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.500
I want to get stronger too, you know!

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:24.620
Having you guys eat this much makes it worth the time spent making it!

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:26.130
Is it good, you two?

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:27.230
Yes!

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:29.260
It's very good!

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:31.270
Your honesty is a pleasure.

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:33.850
There's plenty more, so eat up!

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:36.210
But I'm pretty full now.

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:37.760
Then I'll take some!

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:41.410
That's your tenth one. Don't you think you're overeating?

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:42.950
It's fine.

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:46.780
I'm going to turn all of it into energy and bring out an Avatar!

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:28.040
Are you serious?

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:31.010
Are Avatars something you can bring out by eating onigiri?

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:35.150
I'm not seeing one.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:38.530
I don't think it goes like that...

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:44.180
Well, Nishiki-senpai brought out an Avatar after Someoka-san fed him onigiri!

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:46.270
Oh yeah, now that you mention it...

00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:50.530
But that wasn't because he ate onigiri.

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:57.320
By eating his fill and relaxing, he was able to demonstrate his real power, wasn't it?

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:04.230
But I want to get even stronger so we can win against Fifth Sector.

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:08.550
I'm sure it'll be a big help if I could bring out an Avatar.

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:11.030
I see...

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:12.420
So that's why you ate all that onigiri.

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:15.680
Now that you mention it, I'd sure like to know myself.

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:18.880
Hey, Tenma, how <i>do</i>  you bring it out?

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:20.320
Me?

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:23.680
It sure would be informative, right, Akane-san?

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:25.170
Yeah, I want to know too.

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:27.950
Tenma, if there's a trick to it, tell us.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:31.390
There isn't really a trick or anything...

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:34.130
I don't really get it myself either.

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:40.740
When an Avatar comes out, it's kind of like this bright light bursting out...

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:44.340
Like adding fire to gasoline, getting really heated up...

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:48.240
I'm not sure, sorry.

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:52.690
Using an Avatar even though you don't know how you did it... Avatars sure are a mystery.

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:54.210
But why?

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:57.760
There are people who can use Avatars and people who can't, right?

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:59.490
Where's the difference?

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:08.620
One difference would be that Tsurugi-kun used to be a Seed, while Shin-sama and Tenma-kun aren't...

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:13.390
Tsurugi was able to bring out his Avatar by training under Fifth Sector...

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:17.900
But Captain and I are able to bring them out without that training...

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:21.180
What <i>are</i>  Avatars?

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:24.330
I'll answer that!

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:27.470
I've eaten onigiri and I've relaxed too!

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:30.190
If I work hard, I'll bring one out too!

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:33.000
Then maybe I'll learn something about the Avatars!

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:35.430
All right...

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:36.510
Then let's try it!

00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:38.070
Rather than thinking, take action!

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:41.800
As long as I keep practicing, the results are sure to follow!

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:46.330
How is it, Shinsuke?

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:48.380
Do you feel an Avatar coming?

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:50.810
I don't know if it's an Avatar...

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:54.550
But my body kind of feels heavier than usual!

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:56.980
Not surprising after how much you ate...

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:02.440
Shinsuke, come at me!

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:04.240
All right!

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:08.410
Here it goes!

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:18.200
Captain!

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:20.850
What is it? Do you want to join us for practice?

00:05:20.850 --> 00:05:24.050
No, I came here to deliver some news to you.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:27.060
Deliver some news?

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:29.050
You'll be very happy once you've heard it.

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:31.780
Now that's a hook.

00:05:31.780 --> 00:05:34.480
Don't keep us waiting, hurry and spill.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:38.980
I just got a call from the captains at Tengawara and Mannouzaka Jr. High.

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:46.180
Watching our games made them remember how exciting soccer is.

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:48.980
Really?!

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:51.240
This is incredible!

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:54.480
It sounds like a fair wind's come for Raimon's soccer!

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:55.120
Yeah!

00:05:55.440 --> 00:06:00.580
Soccer has always been an exciting sport to begin with.

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:02.590
That's right, it's fierce!

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:04.940
That's how soccer's gotta be!

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:11.390
Coach Endou must be watching our games from somewhere, right?

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:13.210
Of course he is.

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:15.040
There's no way he'd miss them.

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.750
You're right.

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:19.060
I wonder how he's doing now.

00:06:19.530 --> 00:06:21.690
I wish he was here.

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:23.560
So do I.

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:29.860
I want Coach Endou to be the first to see our soccer as it leads the revolution.

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:32.330
The wind of revolution.

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:33.660
Yeah.

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:37.000
And the first person to make that wind blow...

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:39.670
...was you, Tenma.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:40.690
Me?

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:43.970
He's right! You've been saying it this whole time, remember?

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:45.750
"Things will work out somehow!"

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.680
And they did!

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:49.970
Is that really?

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:51.210
It is really!

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:57.060
What I think, is that after the wind that's Raimon blows through the opposing teams...

00:06:57.060 --> 00:07:01.730
...it lights a small fire of enthusiasm in their hearts!

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:06.970
Now that we're in the Nationals, that fire will burn even greater.

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:09.620
That's exactly right, Akane-san!

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:11.490
This wind won't stop blowing!

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:14.370
Wow, you are on fire today!

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:17.220
They're right.

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:19.850
This wind has always been blowing.

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:22.390
Ever since that day...

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:28.950
It all began on the day I first came to this school.

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:33.330
I'm finally here.

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:34.680
Raimon Jr. High!

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:37.160
It was the Raimon soccer club I'd always admired.

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:38.890
But...

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:46.020
The world of JHS soccer was being controlled by an organization called Fifth Sector.

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:49.730
Is that all you've got?

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:52.250
Let me introduce you.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:53.740
This is the new...

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:57.140
Raimon Eleven.

00:07:57.140 --> 00:08:04.540
The Black Knights came to destroy Raimon, along with the Seed, Tsurugi, who was an observer sent in by Fifth Sector.

00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:11.510
Put on one of the spare uniforms.

00:08:13.140 --> 00:08:14.570
I'm testing you.

00:08:15.380 --> 00:08:16.860
Here I go!

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:24.980
That time, Tenma kept the ball in possession because he didn't want the team to get hurt from the enemy's attacks.

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:38.940
Matsukaze!

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:40.310
You're so reckless...

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:42.300
Please.

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:44.250
Captain...

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:47.700
Don't give up on soccer.

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:56.180
Before I met him, I didn't realize that I'd been obeying Fifth Sector without conscious thought.

00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:00.480
But the reality of it was that I couldn't allow it...

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:02.730
Couldn't allow this soccer that was wrong.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:14.870
The reason I brought out my Avatar was because Tenma's soccer and Tenma's words shook my heart.

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:17.740
That match was an impact on me too.

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:23.090
Before then, I had no idea that Fifth Sector was controlling everything there was about soccer.

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:32.330
I was really looking forward to playing soccer at Raimon, but...

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:34.960
Wait a moment!

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:35.920
Wait!

00:09:36.490 --> 00:09:39.010
Please, don't quit!

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:42.720
A lot of the upperclassmen quit.

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:46.120
And only nine remained.

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:49.580
Captain Shindou told me not to come anymore, but...

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:56.040
But it was my dream to join Raimon's soccer club and play soccer!

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:08.960
I won't ever... give up!

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:14.700
You don't know anything!

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:26.940
I-I've got the ball...

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:30.960
This time... I'll get past...

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:36.430
And so, my and Shinsuke's admittance into the soccer club was accepted.

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:40.280
Shortly after that came the practice match against Eito Academy.

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:46.320
Not even a practice match was exempt from orders on who won or lost, even to the number of goals.

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:48.710
At first, I had no idea about it.

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:57.560
That play...

00:10:57.560 --> 00:10:58.780
Could it be...?

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:02.130
I couldn't forgive that.

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:03.850
This wasn't soccer!

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:14.150
Captain!

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:17.150
Captain!

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:35.830
With that goal, I'd disobeyed Fifth Sector's orders.

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:40.610
Coach Kudou took responsibility for it and was forced to resign.

00:11:40.940 --> 00:11:44.420
It made us realize how serious the situation was.

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:52.810
But to replace Coach Kudou came...

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:55.550
Coach Endou!

00:11:56.910 --> 00:11:58.340
The riverbank?

00:11:58.340 --> 00:12:00.250
Why over there?

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:03.860
You might be able to see something that you wouldn't be able to see from the school grounds.

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:06.990
Something we can't see from the school grounds?

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:09.570
And why do we need to see something like that?

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:11.460
In order to win.

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:12.660
In order to win?

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.540
We're all here.

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:17.790
That was our training for today!

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:20.390
Shindou...

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:24.680
You forgot something.

00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:29.990
Coach Endou gave us the courage to take back real soccer.

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:39.000
Through the wind that Tenma stirred up, Coach Endou gave us an even greater power.

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:44.360
He may not be with us, but Coach Endou still acts as the pillar of all our feelings.

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:45.560
Yes!

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:50.270
By winning, we're connected to Coach Endou!

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:52.930
That's what I think!

00:12:58.300 --> 00:13:01.670
12.23. Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:05.670
Beauty lies within order.

00:13:05.670 --> 00:13:11.500
The individual harmonies of all involved form the beautiful artwork that is soccer.

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:26.250
Are you able to beat the soccer administration syndicate, Fifth Sector?

00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:27.810
It'll work out somehow!

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:30.230
A game system full of new stuff!

00:13:30.230 --> 00:13:31.550
Evolved matches!

00:13:31.550 --> 00:13:34.500
Powered up soccer battles using five versus five!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:36.810
New hissatsu tactics!

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:39.390
A new collection system, "Kizunacks"!

00:13:39.390 --> 00:13:42.400
Strengthen your players with new training spots!

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:45.250
Surprising differences in Shine and Dark!

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:46.920
The story is different!

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:49.120
Scout characters are different!

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:51.050
Avatars are different!

00:13:51.050 --> 00:13:52.480
Teams are different!

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:55.460
And what's more, Coach Endou's wife is different!

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:57.210
The surprising ending!

00:13:57.210 --> 00:13:59.140
No... Captain...

00:13:59.140 --> 00:14:00.300
Matsukaze Tenma!

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:01.640
You're the new captain!

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:03.470
Me... Captain?

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:05.830
New characters are waiting for you!

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:07.930
Surprising stadiums!

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:12.740
The surprising new element, Avatars!

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:19.400
Surprising new hissatsu techniques!

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:26.980
Inazuma Eleven GO - Shine/Dark!

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:29.590
Everything on Inazuma Eleven GO can be found in the games!

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.390
On sale now!

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:36.780
12.23. Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:41.440
And then Holy Road's district preliminaries began!

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:44.520
Our first opponent was Tengawara Jr. High.

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:47.000
The score order said that we were to lose.

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:49.020
Sorry, Matsukaze.

00:14:49.020 --> 00:14:50.360
I can't do it!

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:51.570
But...

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:55.360
I'm not going to obey Fifth Sector's orders.

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:57.160
I'm going for a real win!

00:14:58.710 --> 00:14:59.960
Fortissimo!

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:06.280
Burning Catch!

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:15.270
We disobeyed Fifth Sector's orders in the first match and won against Tengawara.

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:20.060
But our enemies didn't come just from the other teams.

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:23.980
What?

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:27.030
G-Goal!

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:30.070
The first point is an own goal!

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:32.660
I will destroy Raimon!

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:36.370
In our second match against Mannouzaka Jr. High, in Holy Road's district preliminaries,

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:36.360
Dash Train!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:41.550
the upperclassmen who'd been afraid of Fifth Sector this whole time finally made up their minds to fight.

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.380
Surfing Pierrot!

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:46.570
Their hissatsu techniques came out one after the other, and we won against Mannouzaka!

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:47.210
Viva! The Great Wall Of China!

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:51.080
Raimon finally became a unified team!

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:55.250
Our next opponent was Teikoku Academy.

00:15:55.720 --> 00:16:00.600
At this point, Coach Kidou was still the commander of Teikoku's team.

00:16:01.180 --> 00:16:06.620
Now that Raimon had decided to fight Fifth Sector, Teikoku Academy was a formidable opponent unlike any we'd ever faced.

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:09.610
Full Throttle Jump!

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:15.410
But even so, it was a match we couldn't afford to lose.

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:18.340
All except for Tsurugi.

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:21.740
Why aren't you participating in the match?

00:16:22.590 --> 00:16:27.410
On the off-chance that Raimon <i>does</i>  win and Teikoku is defeated,

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:32.090
you will have to give up on the money for your brother's surgery.

00:16:34.270 --> 00:16:42.600
While distressing over his deal with Fifth Sector in regards to his brother, Tsurugi at last decided to abandon Fifth Sector's soccer!

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:43.570
Put me on!

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:46.360
Tsurugi!

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:49.340
Let me play in the match.

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:52.640
Coach Endou...

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:55.120
It's your decision, guys.

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:58.150
I believe in Tsurugi.

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:01.160
Let's go, everyone!

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:07.210
If there's any way for me to make up for my brother's loss...

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:09.630
That would be...

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:12.510
To play the soccer my brother and I share in his stead!

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:14.840
Ultimate Thunder!

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:25.940
Mach Wind!

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:31.770
We won against Teikoku!

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:37.360
And in the district prelim finals, we went up against Kaiou Academy.

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:40.240
Sidewinder!

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:41.910
Even in the finals, our upperclassmen sent out hissatsu techniques one after the other.

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:41.910
Zeroyon!

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:47.420
And, at last, I brought out an Avatar of my own!

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:45.160
Fence Of Gaia!

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:04.210
Demon God Pegasus!

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:07.850
I'll send your Avatar to its grave!

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:10.830
Go!

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:21.710
By winning against Kaiou Academy, our advancement into Holy Road's Nationals tournament was decided!

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:24.610
Captain.

00:18:24.610 --> 00:18:25.820
What is it?

00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:32.630
You, Nishiki-senpai, and I aren't Seeds, so how are we able to bring out Avatars?

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:33.950
Well...

00:18:33.950 --> 00:18:40.300
I asked Tsurugi once, but he wouldn't say anything.

00:18:40.880 --> 00:18:44.810
Perhaps Fifth Sector would know something about the Avatars.

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:47.960
There sure were a lot of Avatars up to now, weren't there?

00:18:50.180 --> 00:18:52.000
Falco Wing!

00:18:56.510 --> 00:18:58.570
Magician's Box!

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:02.110
Guardian Shield!

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:05.160
Dragoon Tedis!

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:09.500
More and more Avatars kept showing up and they all kept getting stronger.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:12.180
Black Wings Raven!

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:15.950
Sonic Speed Barius!

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:18.570
Sea King Poseidon!

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:27.960
Holy Road's Nationals tournament takes place in a Russian roulette stadium broken into six different stadiums.

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:33.240
Our first match was in Cyclone Stadium.

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:36.400
It was unbelievably set up to create cyclones.

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:38.400
Soyokaze Step!

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:42.370
What's more came the arrival of strong Avatars.

00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:45.550
It was a tough fight but we managed to win!

00:19:46.690 --> 00:19:48.950
Giant God Gigantes!

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:56.380
But Gassan Kunimitsu understood in the end that our soccer was the real thing.

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:59.710
Absolute Barrier!

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:04.590
Our second match was in Snowland Stadium against Hakuren Junior High.

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:06.210
I'll get this in no matter what!

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:10.340
Icicle Road!

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:19.470
Just like the other matches, we were able to snap the Hakuren team out from their control under Fifth Sector.

00:20:22.260 --> 00:20:25.450
Let's play soccer together again.

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:34.640
But to think that after this match, Coach Endou would leave us...

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:41.550
Coach Kidou came in to take Coach Endou's place.

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:44.750
And we got even more players!

00:20:42.600 --> 00:20:45.050
Hunter's Net!

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:47.460
First was our defender, Kariya Masaki!

00:20:47.460 --> 00:20:50.680
There's no way it'll work, idiots.

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:53.150
Our forward, Kageyama Hikaru.

00:20:55.940 --> 00:21:01.110
And our midfielder who recently returned from Italy, Nishiki Ryouma-senpai!

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:04.320
Bushin Renzan!

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:08.370
The wind of revolution won't ever stop.

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:11.650
Not until the day we take back real soccer!

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:18.710
What sort of world is Fifth Sector trying to make by managing soccer?

00:21:19.100 --> 00:21:23.350
What lies ahead for all of us by playing soccer with these feelings?

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:28.140
I think the answer to that will come to light after we've won the Holy Road.

00:21:28.830 --> 00:21:32.280
We'll keep fighting to learn what it is.

00:21:32.590 --> 00:21:33.390
Yes!

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:35.620
In any case...

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:39.270
What are the Avatars, really?

00:21:40.760 --> 00:21:45.610
I want to know more about how the other players brought out their Avatars.

00:21:46.550 --> 00:21:50.280
I think by figuring that out, it'll become plain what Fifth Sector is after.

00:21:50.790 --> 00:21:52.340
Avatars, huh?

00:21:52.670 --> 00:21:58.380
If I could bring out an Avatar too, it would sure surprise Coach Endou when he comes back!

00:21:58.670 --> 00:21:59.510
Yeah.

00:21:59.510 --> 00:22:02.400
It sure would be great if we could use Avatars too.

00:22:02.400 --> 00:22:04.360
I pass on that...

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:05.790
I want one!

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:16.480
We still don't know the reason why Coach Endou left us.

00:22:17.070 --> 00:22:21.210
But Coach is surely fighting the same fight we are, somewhere.

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:26.840
We may be far apart, but the wind of our revolution will surely reach Coach Endou where he is!

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:27.940
Tenma!

00:22:27.940 --> 00:22:28.610
Okay!

00:22:29.650 --> 00:22:31.130
Coach Endou.

00:22:31.130 --> 00:22:33.390
We'll continue to fight!

00:22:33.390 --> 00:22:38.180
Soccer is sure to be waiting for the day when everyone plays real soccer, just like us!

00:22:50.740 --> 00:22:54.810
The wind blowing from Raimon will get even stronger!

00:24:23.290 --> 00:24:25.310
Sawa Homare is transferring to a different team!

00:24:25.590 --> 00:24:26.690
Which team?

00:24:26.690 --> 00:24:27.570
Where?

00:24:27.570 --> 00:24:28.400
It's Raimon!

00:24:28.640 --> 00:24:30.650
Raimon is a junior high school team...

00:24:30.650 --> 00:24:31.280
Huh?

00:24:32.570 --> 00:24:34.260
The strongest soccer that even Sawa's fallen for!

00:24:34.260 --> 00:24:36.160
Inazuma Eleven GO the movie!

00:24:36.160 --> 00:24:37.910
I'll do my best!

00:24:38.630 --> 00:24:40.260
A shocking past.

00:24:40.260 --> 00:24:44.040
Amagi-senpai, let's hit them with our fierce soccer!

00:24:44.040 --> 00:24:48.670
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 A Mysterious Enemy! Gen'ei Academy!!

00:24:48.670 --> 00:24:50.350
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:24:59.950 --> 00:25:02.890
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:25:07.320 --> 00:25:12.440
Rather than thinking, take action! 
 As long as I keep practicing, the results are sure to follow!

00:25:12.440 --> 00:25:13.420
That's all!
